        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Thei mei nzaeng dih ram gai rui",
            "Rangbang tat tuan kei ngam thuimak ,",
            "Zingmei guangdi ramgai ta mang man na",
            "Kamthao ngham thui lakge, Raguangh .",
            "",
            "He ramthai makmei rou guai",
            "Nang Raguang lat nkingh o",
            "Ringpou thiu la mbun lou na",
            "Nang trou khou rui ti-ring thao lou puni.",
            "",
            "2. Theimei rou kum aniu guai hei",
            "Ringna, ringna, ramthai mak khe,",
            "Thei mei chaeng khou thei puni thai makna",
            "Maan ngam kan nikum the, Ravguangc.",
            "",
            "3. Theimei nang ring dat ni cho?",
            "Taruai khamtaan akhou nai e;",
            "Tingsang banthai ram thang phung guang lou ni",
            "Ai ping thai na lung e thei.",
            "",
            "4. Ringpou thiula puan zing kum na",
            "Dih kun padeic khou rui guang o",
            "Lung ning kathan bumaeng than tilou o",
            "Nang lat danc guay piw na lung khang.",
            "",
            " Pastor Abui"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
